# Probes the C reference compiles and the shipped product REFUSES by name (it
# never accepts them with different bytes), one per line: <probe> <reason>.
# Opened 0.0.21 for reference fixes the product mirrors as refusals first; the
# implementations are 0.0.22.  A listed probe the product starts accepting must
# be removed (tests/tapebinproduct.py fails it), so the list cannot rot.
a_tdarr.c 0.0.22 static local of a typedef'd array type, then indexed
a_tdlate.c 0.0.22 __builtin_offsetof, comma controls, late-completed typedef sizes
a_bighex.c 0.0.22 hex/octal constant past LLONG_MAX (unsigned long long); the product refuses by name -- 0.0.23 F4
